Z||000003||88GT||01-14-2000||12:47 AM||||I LOVE the GT's and if I had the money would buy 2.  One to keep as is and one to modify. My project car is probably a few years off.  I could go with a 88 coupe and still get the suspension geometry that I want.  That is probably what I'll do when the time comes.  Whatever car I buy I need to make sure it has the options I want: A/C PW, Pdl, etc.  We'll see what happens.  I just wish I got to this one earlier as I loved my 87 GT and long for another.||||reg||1
